{{Term/Store|Chillshroom|Chillshrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Chillshroom}}
Chillshrooms are found at the base of [[Tree]]s in the [[Hebra Mountains]] and on [[Mount Lanayru]]. They can also be bought in [[Gerudo Town]] from [[Ardin]]'s [[Stall]]. When eaten, they restore half of a [[Heart]]. A Chillshroom that is exposed to [[Fire]] will turn into a [[Toasty Chillshroom]]. [[Food]] made using a Chillshroom will grant [[Link]] [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to create [[Blue Dye]].

